  (text "DESIGN NOTES (issue 2, claude/issues.md)\n\n- P1: chumbilical. Pin numbers PROVISIONAL until the cable is beeped out.\n- 5 V ONLY into the daughtercard DC jack. The original 12 V wall wart WILL FRY the Pi.\n- J4/J5 carry data+GND only; P50V feeds both daughtercard USB jacks from the local 5 V rail.\n- J2 mates Raspberry Pi header pins 17-26 1:1 (3V3, SPI0+CE0/CE1, 2x GND, GPIO24=bend, GPIO25=reset).\n- Bend moves off FR3's GPIO17 -> gpio-key config change.\n- HP_NOTIN placement still undecided; parked on the screw terminal."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30 170 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "076b7a50-13ca-47b5-876f-a21c0df56938"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
